# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang {#background}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to solve the Market Split problem using [Kipu"
" Quantum's Iskay quantum optimizer](/guides/kipu-optimization) "
"[\\[1\\]](#references). The Market Split problem represents a real-world "
"resource allocation challenge where markets must be partitioned into "
"balanced sales regions to meet exact demand targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini menunjukkan cara menyelesaikan masalah Market Split menggunakan"
" [Iskay quantum optimizer dari Kipu Quantum](/guides/kipu-optimization) "
"[\\[1\\]](#references). Masalah Market Split merepresentasikan tantangan "
"alokasi sumber daya di dunia nyata, di mana pasar harus dipartisi menjadi "
"wilayah penjualan yang seimbang untuk memenuhi target permintaan yang "
"tepat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The Market Split challenge {#the-market-split-challenge}"
msgstr "Tantangan Market Split {#the-market-split-challenge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Market Split problem presents a deceptively simple yet computationally "
"formidable challenge in resource allocation. Consider a company with $m$ "
"products being sold across $n$ different markets, where each market "
"purchases a specific bundle of products (represented by the columns of "
"matrix $A$). The business objective is to partition these markets into two "
"balanced sales regions such that each region receives exactly half the total"
" demand for every product.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masalah Market Split menghadirkan tantangan yang tampak sederhana namun "
"secara komputasi sangat sulit dalam hal alokasi sumber daya. Bayangkan "
"sebuah perusahaan dengan $m$ produk yang dijual di $n$ pasar berbeda, di "
"mana setiap pasar membeli sekumpulan produk tertentu (direpresentasikan oleh"
" kolom-kolom matriks $A$). Tujuan bisnis adalah membagi pasar-pasar tersebut"
" menjadi dua wilayah penjualan yang seimbang sehingga setiap wilayah "
"menerima tepat setengah dari total permintaan untuk setiap produk.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Mathematical formulation:**\n"
msgstr "**Formulasi matematis:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We seek a binary assignment vector $x$, where:\n"
"- $x_j = 1$ assigns market $j$ to Region A\n"
"- $x_j = 0$ assigns market $j$ to Region B\n"
"- The constraint $Ax = b$ must be satisfied, where $b$ represents the target sales (typically half the total demand per product)\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita mencari vektor penugasan biner $x$, di mana:\n"
"- $x_j = 1$ menugaskan pasar $j$ ke Wilayah A\n"
"- $x_j = 0$ menugaskan pasar $j$ ke Wilayah B\n"
"- Kendala $Ax = b$ harus dipenuhi, di mana $b$ merepresentasikan target penjualan (biasanya setengah dari total permintaan per produk)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Cost function:**\n"
msgstr "**Fungsi biaya:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To solve this problem, we minimize the squared constraint violation:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menyelesaikan masalah ini, kita meminimalkan kuadrat pelanggaran "
"kendala:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij}x_j - "
"b_i\\right)^2$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n} A_{ij}x_j - "
"b_i\\right)^2$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where:\n"
"- $A_{ij}$ represents the sales of product $i$ in market $j$\n"
"- $x_j \\in \\{0,1\\}$ is the binary assignment of market $j$\n"
"- $b_i$ is the target sales for product $i$ in each region\n"
"- The cost equals zero precisely when all constraints are satisfied\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana:\n"
"- $A_{ij}$ merepresentasikan penjualan produk $i$ di pasar $j$\n"
"- $x_j \\in \\{0,1\\}$ adalah penugasan biner pasar $j$\n"
"- $b_i$ adalah target penjualan produk $i$ di setiap wilayah\n"
"- Biaya sama dengan nol tepat ketika semua kendala terpenuhi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each term in the sum represents the squared deviation from the target sales "
"for a particular product. When we expand this cost function, we get:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap suku dalam jumlah mewakili deviasi kuadrat dari target penjualan "
"untuk produk tertentu. Ketika kita mengekspansi fungsi biaya ini, kita "
"mendapatkan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since $b^T b$ is a constant, minimizing $C(x)$ is equivalent to minimizing "
"the quadratic function $x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x$, which is exactly a QUBO "
"(Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization) problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Karena $b^T b$ adalah konstanta, meminimalkan $C(x)$ setara dengan "
"meminimalkan fungsi kuadratik $x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x$, yang merupakan "
"masalah QUBO (Quadratic Unconstrained Binary Optimization).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Computational complexity:**\n"
msgstr "**Kompleksitas komputasi:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Despite its straightforward business interpretation, this problem exhibits remarkable computational intractability:\n"
"- **Small-scale failure**: Conventional Mixed Integer Programming solvers fail on instances with as few as seven products under a timeout of one hour [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
"- **Exponential growth**: The solution space grows exponentially ($2^n$ possible assignments), making brute force approaches infeasible\n"
msgstr ""
"Meskipun interpretasi bisnisnya lugas, masalah ini menunjukkan kerumitan komputasi yang luar biasa:\n"
"- **Kegagalan skala kecil**: Solver Mixed Integer Programming konvensional gagal pada instans dengan hanya tujuh produk dalam batas waktu satu jam [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
"- **Pertumbuhan eksponensial**: Ruang solusi tumbuh secara eksponensial ($2^n$ kemungkinan penugasan), membuat pendekatan brute force tidak layak\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This severe computational barrier, combined with its practical relevance to "
"territory planning and resource allocation, makes the Market Split problem "
"an ideal benchmark for quantum optimization algorithms "
"[\\[4\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Hambatan komputasi yang parah ini, dikombinasikan dengan relevansinya yang "
"nyata dalam perencanaan wilayah dan alokasi sumber daya, menjadikan masalah "
"Market Split sebagai tolok ukur ideal untuk algoritma optimasi kuantum "
"[\\[4\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"What makes Iskay's approach unique? {#what-makes-iskays-approach-unique}"
msgstr ""
"Apa yang membuat pendekatan Iskay unik? {#what-makes-iskays-approach-unique}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Iskay optimizer uses the **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic"
" quantum optimization)** algorithm [\\[1\\]](#references), which represents "
"a significant advancement in quantum optimization:\n"
msgstr ""
"Iskay optimizer menggunakan algoritma **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized "
"counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** [\\[1\\]](#references), yang "
"merupakan kemajuan signifikan dalam optimasi kuantum:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Circuit efficiency**: The bf-DCQO algorithm achieves remarkable gate reduction [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- Up to **10 times fewer entangling gates** than Digital Quantum Annealing (DQA)\n"
"- Significantly shallower circuits enable:\n"
"  - Less error accumulation during quantum execution\n"
"  - Ability to tackle larger problems on current quantum hardware\n"
"  - No need for error mitigation techniques\n"
msgstr ""
"**Efisiensi Circuit**: Algoritma bf-DCQO mencapai pengurangan gate yang luar biasa [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- Hingga **10 kali lebih sedikit entangling gate** dibandingkan Digital Quantum Annealing (DQA)\n"
"- Circuit yang jauh lebih dangkal memungkinkan:\n"
"  - Akumulasi error yang lebih sedikit selama eksekusi kuantum\n"
"  - Kemampuan menangani masalah yang lebih besar pada perangkat keras kuantum saat ini\n"
"  - Tidak perlu teknik mitigasi error\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Non-variational design**: Unlike variational algorithms requiring approximately 100 iterations, bf-DCQO typically needs only **approximately 10 iterations** [\\[1\\]](#references). This is achieved through:\n"
"- Intelligent bias-field calculations from measured state distributions\n"
"- Starting each iteration from an energy state near the previous solution\n"
"- Integrated classical post-processing with local search\n"
msgstr ""
"**Desain non-variasional**: Berbeda dengan algoritma variasional yang membutuhkan sekitar 100 iterasi, bf-DCQO biasanya hanya membutuhkan **sekitar 10 iterasi** [\\[1\\]](#references). Hal ini dicapai melalui:\n"
"- Perhitungan bias-field yang cerdas dari distribusi state yang terukur\n"
"- Memulai setiap iterasi dari state energi dekat solusi sebelumnya\n"
"- Post-processing klasikal terintegrasi dengan local search\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Counterdiabatic protocols**: The algorithm incorporates counterdiabatic "
"terms that suppress unwanted quantum excitations during short evolution "
"times, enabling the system to remain near the ground state even with rapid "
"transitions [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Protokol counterdiabatic**: Algoritma ini menggabungkan suku-suku "
"counterdiabatic yang menekan eksitasi kuantum yang tidak diinginkan selama "
"waktu evolusi singkat, memungkinkan sistem tetap mendekati ground state "
"bahkan dengan transisi cepat [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

