# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Problem instances from QOBLIB (Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library) "
"[\\[2\\]](#references) are stored in a simple text format. Let's examine the"
" actual content of our target instance `ms_03_200_177.dat`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Instans masalah dari QOBLIB (Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library) "
"[\\[2\\]](#references) disimpan dalam format teks sederhana. Mari kita "
