"  - `3` = jumlah produk (kendala/baris dalam matriks $A$)\n"
"  - `20` = jumlah pasar (variabel/kolom dalam matriks $A$)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Next 3 lines:** Coefficient matrix $A$ and target vector $b$\n"
msgstr "**3 baris berikutnya:** Matriks koefisien $A$ dan vektor target $b$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Each line has 21 numbers: first 20 are row coefficients, last is the "
"target\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap baris memiliki 21 angka: 20 pertama adalah koefisien baris, terakhir "
"adalah targetnya\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Line 2: `60 92 161 ... 51 | 1002`\n"
msgstr "Baris 2: `60 92 161 ... 51 | 1002`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "First 20 numbers: How much of Product 1 each of the 20 markets sells\n"
msgstr ""
"20 angka pertama: Berapa banyak Produk 1 yang dijual masing-masing dari 20 "
"pasar\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Last number (1002): Target sales for Product 1 in one region\n"
msgstr "Angka terakhir (1002): Target penjualan Produk 1 di satu wilayah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Line 3: `176 196 41 ... 46 | 879`\n"
msgstr "Baris 3: `176 196 41 ... 46 | 879`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Product 2 sales per market and target (879)\n"
msgstr "Penjualan Produk 2 per pasar dan target (879)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Line 4: `68 68 179 ... 95 | 1040`\n"
msgstr "Baris 4: `68 68 179 ... 95 | 1040`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Product 3 sales per market and target (1040)\n"
msgstr "Penjualan Produk 3 per pasar dan target (1040)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Business interpretation:**\n"
"- Market 0 sells: 60 units of Product 1, 176 units of Product 2, 68 units of Product 3\n"
"- Market 1 sells: 92 units of Product 1, 196 units of Product 2, 68 units of Product 3\n"
"- And so on for all 20 markets...\n"
"- **Goal**: Split these 20 markets into two regions where each region gets exactly 1002 units of Product 1, 879 units of Product 2, and 1040 units of Product 3\n"
msgstr ""
"**Interpretasi bisnis:**\n"
"- Pasar 0 menjual: 60 unit Produk 1, 176 unit Produk 2, 68 unit Produk 3\n"
"- Pasar 1 menjual: 92 unit Produk 1, 196 unit Produk 2, 68 unit Produk 3\n"
"- Dan seterusnya untuk semua 20 pasar...\n"
"- **Tujuan**: Bagi 20 pasar ini menjadi dua wilayah di mana setiap wilayah mendapatkan tepat 1002 unit Produk 1, 879 unit Produk 2, dan 1040 unit Produk 3\n"

