msgstr ""
"Dari kendala ke QUBO: transformasi matematis {#from-constraints-to-qubo-the-"
"mathematical-transformation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The power of quantum optimization lies in transforming constrained problems "
"into unconstrained quadratic forms [\\[4\\]](#references). For the Market "
"Split problem, we convert the equality constraints\n"
msgstr ""
"Kekuatan optimasi kuantum terletak pada transformasi masalah berkendala "
"menjadi bentuk kuadratik tanpa kendala [\\[4\\]](#references). Untuk masalah"
" Market Split, kita mengonversi kendala persamaan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$ Ax = b $$\n"
msgstr "$$ Ax = b $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $x ∈ \\{0,1\\}^n$, into a QUBO by penalizing constraint violations.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $x ∈ \\{0,1\\}^n$, menjadi QUBO dengan menghukum pelanggaran "
"kendala.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The penalty method:**\n"
"Since we need $Ax = b$ to hold exactly, we minimize the squared violation:\n"
"$$f(x) = ||Ax - b||^2$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Metode penalti:**\n"
"Karena kita membutuhkan $Ax = b$ terpenuhi secara tepat, kita meminimalkan kuadrat pelanggaran:\n"
"$$f(x) = ||Ax - b||^2$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This equals zero precisely when all constraints are satisfied. Expanding algebraically:\n"
"$$f(x) = (Ax - b)^T(Ax - b) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini sama dengan nol tepat ketika semua kendala terpenuhi. Mengekspansi secara aljabar:\n"
"$$f(x) = (Ax - b)^T(Ax - b) = x^T A^T A x - 2b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**QUBO objective:**\n"
"Since $b^T b$ is constant, our optimization becomes:\n"
"$$\\text{minimize} \\quad Q(x) = x^T(A^T A)x - 2(A^T b)^T x$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Objektif QUBO:**\n"
"Karena $b^T b$ adalah konstanta, optimasi kita menjadi:\n"
"$$\\text{minimize} \\quad Q(x) = x^T(A^T A)x - 2(A^T b)^T x$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Key insight:** This transformation is exact, not approximate. Equality "
"constraints naturally square into quadratic form without requiring auxiliary"
" variables or penalty parameters - making this formulation mathematically "
"elegant and computationally efficient for quantum solvers "
"[\\[4\\]](#references). We'll use the `OptimizationProblem` class to define "
"our constrained problem, then convert it to QUBO format using "
"`OptimizationProblemToQubo`, both from the **qiskit_addon_opt_mapper** "
"package. This automatically handles the penalty-based transformation.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Wawasan utama:** Transformasi ini bersifat eksak, bukan aproksimasi. "
"Kendala persamaan secara alami dikuadratkan menjadi bentuk kuadratik tanpa "
"membutuhkan variabel bantu atau parameter penalti — menjadikan formulasi ini"
" elegan secara matematis dan efisien secara komputasi untuk solver kuantum "
"[\\[4\\]](#references). Kita akan menggunakan kelas `OptimizationProblem` "
"untuk mendefinisikan masalah berkendala kita, lalu mengonversinya ke format "
"QUBO menggunakan `OptimizationProblemToQubo`, keduanya dari paket "
"**qiskit_addon_opt_mapper**. Ini secara otomatis menangani transformasi "
"berbasis penalti.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Implement data loading and QUBO conversion functions {#implement-data-"
"loading-and-qubo-conversion-functions}"
msgstr ""
"Implementasi fungsi pemuatan data dan konversi QUBO {#implement-data-"
"loading-and-qubo-conversion-functions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
