# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Convert to QUBO format {#convert-to-qubo-format}"
msgstr "Konversi ke format QUBO {#convert-to-qubo-format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We now transform the constrained optimization problem into QUBO format:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita sekarang mentransformasi masalah optimasi berkendala menjadi format "
"QUBO:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Convert QUBO to Iskay format {#convert-qubo-to-iskay-format}"
msgstr "Konversi QUBO ke format Iskay {#convert-qubo-to-iskay-format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we need to convert the QUBO object into the dictionary format required "
"by Kipu Quantum's Iskay Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita perlu mengonversi objek QUBO ke format kamus yang diperlukan "
"oleh Iskay Optimizer dari Kipu Quantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `problem` and `problem_type` arguments encode an optimization problem of"
" the form\n"
msgstr ""
"Argumen `problem` dan `problem_type` mengodekan masalah optimasi dalam "
"bentuk\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\min_{(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\in D} C(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\nonumber\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
"where\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align}\n"
"\\min_{(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\in D} C(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n) \\nonumber\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
"di mana\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"C(x_1, ... , x_n) = a + \\sum_{i} b_i x_i + \\sum_{i, j} c_{i, j} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum_{k_1, ..., k_m} g_{k_1, ..., k_m} x_{k_1} ... x_{k_m}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"C(x_1, ... , x_n) = a + \\sum_{i} b_i x_i + \\sum_{i, j} c_{i, j} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum_{k_1, ..., k_m} g_{k_1, ..., k_m} x_{k_1} ... x_{k_m}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By choosing `problem_type = \"binary\"`, you specify that the cost function "
"is in `binary` format, which means that $D = \\{0,  1\\}^{n}$, as in, the "
"cost function is written in QUBO/HUBO formulation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan memilih `problem_type = \"binary\"`, kamu menentukan bahwa fungsi "
"biaya dalam format `binary`, yang berarti $D = \\{0,  1\\}^{n}$, yaitu "
"fungsi biaya ditulis dalam formulasi QUBO/HUBO.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the other hand, by choosing `problem_type = \"spin\"`, the cost function "
"is written in Ising formulation, where $D = \\{-1, 1\\}^{n}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sisi lain, dengan memilih `problem_type = \"spin\"`, fungsi biaya ditulis"
" dalam formulasi Ising, di mana $D = \\{-1, 1\\}^{n}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The coefficients of the problem should be encoded in a dictionary as follows:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align} \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\{} \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"()\"}&: \\quad &a, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i,)\"}&: \\quad &b_i, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i, j)\"}&: \\quad &c_{i, j}, \\quad (i \\neq j) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\quad  \\vdots \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(} k_1, ..., k_m  \\texttt{)\"}&: \\quad &g_{k_1, ..., k_m}, \\quad (k_1 \\neq k_2 \\neq \\dots \\neq k_m) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\}}\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Koefisien masalah harus dikodekan dalam kamus sebagai berikut:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\begin{align} \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\{} \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"()\"}&: \\quad &a, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i,)\"}&: \\quad &b_i, \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(i, j)\"}&: \\quad &c_{i, j}, \\quad (i \\neq j) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\quad  \\vdots \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\"(} k_1, ..., k_m  \\texttt{)\"}&: \\quad &g_{k_1, ..., k_m}, \\quad (k_1 \\neq k_2 \\neq \\dots \\neq k_m) \\\\ \\nonumber\n"
"&\\texttt{\\}}\n"
"\\end{align}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the keys of the dictionary must be strings containing a valid "
"tuple of non-repeating integers. For binary problems, we know that:\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa kunci kamus harus berupa string yang mengandung tuple "
"integer non-berulang yang valid. Untuk masalah biner, kita tahu bahwa:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"x_i^2 = x_i\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"x_i^2 = x_i\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for $i=j$ (since $x_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$ means $x_i \\cdot x_i = x_i$). So, in "
"your QUBO formulation, if you have both linear contributions $b_i x_i$ and "
"diagonal quadratic contributions $c_{i,i} x_i^2$, these terms must be "
"combined into a single linear coefficient:\n"
msgstr ""
"untuk $i=j$ (karena $x_i \\in \\{0,1\\}$ berarti $x_i \\cdot x_i = x_i$). "
"Jadi, dalam formulasi QUBO kamu, jika kamu memiliki kontribusi linear $b_i "
"x_i$ dan kontribusi kuadratik diagonal $c_{i,i} x_i^2$, suku-suku ini harus "
"digabungkan menjadi satu koefisien linear:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Total linear coefficient for variable $x_i$:** $b_i + c_{i,i}$\n"
msgstr "**Total koefisien linear untuk variabel $x_i$:** $b_i + c_{i,i}$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This means:\n"
"- Linear terms like `\"(i, )\"` contain: original linear coefficient + diagonal quadratic coefficient\n"
"- Diagonal quadratic terms like `\"(i, i)\"` should **NOT** appear in the final dictionary\n"
"- Only off-diagonal quadratic terms like `\"(i, j)\"` where $i \\neq j$ should be included as separate entries\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini berarti:\n"
"- Suku linear seperti `\"(i, )\"` mengandung: koefisien linear asli + koefisien kuadratik diagonal\n"
"- Suku kuadratik diagonal seperti `\"(i, i)\"` **TIDAK** boleh muncul dalam kamus akhir\n"
"- Hanya suku kuadratik off-diagonal seperti `\"(i, j)\"` di mana $i \\neq j$ yang harus dimasukkan sebagai entri terpisah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Example:** If your QUBO has $3x_1 + 2x_1^2 + 4x_1 x_2$, the Iskay dictionary should contain:\n"
"- `\"(0, )\"`: `5.0` (combining $3 + 2 = 5$)\n"
"- `\"(0, 1)\"`: `4.0` (off-diagonal term)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Contoh:** Jika QUBO kamu memiliki $3x_1 + 2x_1^2 + 4x_1 x_2$, kamus Iskay harus mengandung:\n"
"- `\"(0, )\"`: `5.0` (menggabungkan $3 + 2 = 5$)\n"
"- `\"(0, 1)\"`: `4.0` (suku off-diagonal)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**NOT** separate entries for `\"(0, )\"`: `3.0` and `\"(0, 0)\"`: `2.0`.\n"
msgstr "**BUKAN** entri terpisah untuk `\"(0, )\"`: `3.0` dan `\"(0, 0)\"`: `2.0`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the bf-DCQO algorithm {#understand-the-bf-dcqo-algorithm}"
msgstr "Pahami algoritma bf-DCQO {#understand-the-bf-dcqo-algorithm}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before we run the optimization, let's understand the sophisticated quantum "
"algorithm that powers Iskay: **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized counterdiabatic"
" quantum optimization)** [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum kita menjalankan optimasi, mari kita pahami algoritma kuantum "
"canggih yang menggerakkan Iskay: **bf-DCQO (bias-field digitized "
"counterdiabatic quantum optimization)** [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What is bf-DCQO? {#what-is-bf-dcqo}"
msgstr "Apa itu bf-DCQO? {#what-is-bf-dcqo}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bf-DCQO is based on the time evolution of a quantum system where the problem"
" solution is encoded in the **ground state** (lowest energy state) of the "
"final quantum Hamiltonian [\\[1\\]](#references). The algorithm addresses a "
"fundamental challenge in quantum optimization:\n"
msgstr ""
"bf-DCQO didasarkan pada evolusi waktu sistem kuantum di mana solusi masalah "
"dikodekan dalam **ground state** (state energi terendah) dari Hamiltonian "
"kuantum akhir [\\[1\\]](#references). Algoritma ini mengatasi tantangan "
"mendasar dalam optimasi kuantum:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The challenge**: Traditional adiabatic quantum computing requires very "
"slow evolution to maintain ground state conditions according to the "
"adiabatic theorem. This demands increasingly deep quantum circuits as "
"problem complexity grows, leading to more gate operations and accumulated "
"errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tantangannya**: Komputasi kuantum adiabatik tradisional membutuhkan "
"evolusi yang sangat lambat untuk mempertahankan kondisi ground state sesuai "
"dengan teorema adiabatik. Ini membutuhkan Circuit yang semakin dalam seiring"
" bertambahnya kompleksitas masalah, menghasilkan lebih banyak operasi gate "
"dan akumulasi error.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The solution**: bf-DCQO uses counterdiabatic protocols to enable rapid "
"evolution while maintaining ground state fidelity, dramatically reducing "
"circuit depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Solusinya**: bf-DCQO menggunakan protokol counterdiabatic untuk "
"memungkinkan evolusi cepat sambil mempertahankan fidelitas ground state, "
"yang secara dramatis mengurangi kedalaman Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Mathematical framework {#mathematical-framework}"
msgstr "Kerangka matematis {#mathematical-framework}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The algorithm minimizes a cost function of the form:\n"
msgstr "Algoritma meminimalkan fungsi biaya dalam bentuk:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$\\min_{(x_1,x_2,...,x_n) \\in D} C(x_1,x_2,...,x_n)$$\n"
msgstr "$$\\min_{(x_1,x_2,...,x_n) \\in D} C(x_1,x_2,...,x_n)$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where $D = \\{0,1\\}^n$ for binary variables and:\n"
msgstr "di mana $D = \\{0,1\\}^n$ untuk variabel biner dan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$C(x) = a + \\sum_i b_i x_i + \\sum_{i,j} c_{ij} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum "
"g_{k_1,...,k_m} x_{k_1}...x_{k_m}$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$C(x) = a + \\sum_i b_i x_i + \\sum_{i,j} c_{ij} x_i x_j + ... + \\sum "
"g_{k_1,...,k_m} x_{k_1}...x_{k_m}$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For our Market Split problem, the cost function is:\n"
msgstr "Untuk masalah Market Split kita, fungsi biayanya adalah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = x^T A^T A x - 2 b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"
msgstr "$$C(x) = ||Ax - b||^2 = x^T A^T A x - 2 b^T A x + b^T b$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The role of counterdiabatic terms {#the-role-of-counterdiabatic-terms}"
msgstr "Peran suku-suku counterdiabatic {#the-role-of-counterdiabatic-terms}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Counterdiabatic terms** are additional terms introduced into the time-"
"dependent Hamiltonian that suppress unwanted excitations during the quantum "
"evolution. Here's why they're crucial:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Suku-suku counterdiabatic** adalah suku-suku tambahan yang dimasukkan ke "
"dalam Hamiltonian bergantung-waktu yang menekan eksitasi yang tidak "
"diinginkan selama evolusi kuantum. Berikut mengapa mereka sangat penting:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In adiabatic quantum optimization, we evolve the system according to a time-"
"dependent Hamiltonian:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam optimasi kuantum adiabatik, kita mengevolusi sistem sesuai dengan "
"Hamiltonian bergantung-waktu:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$H(t) = \\left(1 - \\frac{t}{T}\\right) H_{\\text{initial}} + \\frac{t}{T} "
"H_{\\text{problem}}$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$H(t) = \\left(1 - \\frac{t}{T}\\right) H_{\\text{initial}} + \\frac{t}{T} "
"H_{\\text{problem}}$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $H_{\\text{problem}}$ encodes our optimization problem. To maintain "
"the ground state during rapid evolution, we add counterdiabatic terms:\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $H_{\\text{problem}}$ mengodekan masalah optimasi kita. Untuk "
"mempertahankan ground state selama evolusi cepat, kita menambahkan suku-suku"
" counterdiabatic:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$H_{\\text{CD}}(t) = H(t) + H_{\\text{counter}}(t)$$\n"
msgstr "$$H_{\\text{CD}}(t) = H(t) + H_{\\text{counter}}(t)$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These counterdiabatic terms do the following:\n"
"1. **Suppress unwanted transitions**: Prevent the quantum state from jumping to excited states during fast evolution\n"
"2. **Enable shorter evolution times**: Allow us to reach the final state much faster without violating adiabaticity\n"
"3. **Reduce circuit depth**: Shorter evolution leads to fewer gates and less error\n"
msgstr ""
"Suku-suku counterdiabatic ini melakukan hal berikut:\n"
"1. **Menekan transisi yang tidak diinginkan**: Mencegah state kuantum melompat ke state tereksitasi selama evolusi cepat\n"
"2. **Memungkinkan waktu evolusi yang lebih singkat**: Memungkinkan kita mencapai state akhir jauh lebih cepat tanpa melanggar adiabatisitas\n"
"3. **Mengurangi kedalaman Circuit**: Evolusi yang lebih singkat menghasilkan lebih sedikit gate dan lebih sedikit error\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The practical impact is dramatic: bf-DCQO uses up to **10 times fewer "
"entangling gates** than Digital Quantum Annealing [\\[1\\]](#references), "
"making it practical for today's noisy quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dampak praktisnya sangat dramatis: bf-DCQO menggunakan hingga **10 kali "
"lebih sedikit entangling gate** dibandingkan Digital Quantum Annealing "
"[\\[1\\]](#references), membuatnya praktis untuk perangkat keras kuantum "
"saat ini yang masih bising.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Bias-field iterative optimization {#bias-field-iterative-optimization}"
msgstr ""
"Optimasi iteratif berbasis bias-field {#bias-field-iterative-optimization}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unlike variational algorithms that optimize circuit parameters through many "
"iterations, bf-DCQO uses a **bias-field guided approach** that converges in "
"approximately 10 iterations [1]:\n"
msgstr ""
"Berbeda dengan algoritma variasional yang mengoptimalkan parameter Circuit "
"melalui banyak iterasi, bf-DCQO menggunakan **pendekatan berbasis bias-"
"field** yang konvergen dalam sekitar 10 iterasi [1]:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Iteration process:**\n"
msgstr "**Proses iterasi:**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Initial quantum evolution**: Start with a quantum circuit implementing the"
" counterdiabatic evolution protocol\n"
msgstr ""
"**Evolusi kuantum awal**: Mulai dengan Circuit kuantum yang "
"mengimplementasikan protokol evolusi counterdiabatic\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Measurement**: Measure the quantum state to obtain a probability "
"distribution over bitstrings\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengukuran**: Ukur state kuantum untuk mendapatkan distribusi probabilitas"
" atas bitstring\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bias-field calculation**: Analyze the measurement statistics and calculate an optimal bias-field $h_i$ for each qubit:\n"
"$$h_i = \\text{f}(\\text{measurement statistics}, \\text{previous solutions})$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Perhitungan bias-field**: Analisis statistik pengukuran dan hitung bias-field optimal $h_i$ untuk setiap qubit:\n"
"$$h_i = \\text{f}(\\text{measurement statistics}, \\text{previous solutions})$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Next iteration**: The bias-field modifies the Hamiltonian for the next iteration:\n"
"$$H_{\\text{next}} = H_{\\text{problem}} + \\sum_i h_i \\sigma_i^z$$\n"
msgstr ""
"**Iterasi berikutnya**: Bias-field memodifikasi Hamiltonian untuk iterasi berikutnya:\n"
"$$H_{\\text{next}} = H_{\\text{problem}} + \\sum_i h_i \\sigma_i^z$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This allows starting near the previously found good solution, effectively"
" performing a form of \"quantum local search\"\n"
msgstr ""
"   Ini memungkinkan memulai dekat solusi baik yang ditemukan sebelumnya, "
"secara efektif melakukan \"quantum local search\"\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Convergence**: Repeat until the solution quality stabilizes or a maximum "
"number of iterations is reached\n"
msgstr ""
"**Konvergensi**: Ulangi hingga kualitas solusi stabil atau jumlah iterasi "
"maksimum tercapai\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Key advantage**: Each iteration provides meaningful progress toward the "
"optimal solution by incorporating information from previous measurements, "
"unlike variational methods that must explore the parameter space blindly.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Keunggulan utama**: Setiap iterasi memberikan kemajuan berarti menuju "
"solusi optimal dengan menggabungkan informasi dari pengukuran sebelumnya, "
"tidak seperti metode variasional yang harus mengeksplorasi ruang parameter "
"secara buta.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Integrated classical post-processing {#integrated-classical-post-processing}"
msgstr ""
"Post-processing klasikal terintegrasi {#integrated-classical-post-"
"processing}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the quantum optimization converges, Iskay performs classical **local "
"search** post-processing:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah optimasi kuantum konvergen, Iskay melakukan **local search** post-"
"processing klasikal:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bit-flip exploration**: Systematically or randomly flip bits in the best "
"measured solution\n"
msgstr ""
"**Eksplorasi bit-flip**: Membalik bit secara sistematis atau acak dalam "
"solusi terukur terbaik\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Energy evaluation**: Calculate $C(x)$ for each modified solution\n"
msgstr ""
"**Evaluasi energi**: Hitung $C(x)$ untuk setiap solusi yang dimodifikasi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Greedy selection**: Accept improvements that lower the cost function\n"
msgstr "**Seleksi greedy**: Terima perbaikan yang menurunkan fungsi biaya\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Multiple passes**: Perform several passes (controlled by "
"`postprocessing_level`)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Beberapa pass**: Lakukan beberapa pass (dikontrol oleh "
"`postprocessing_level`)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This hybrid approach compensates for bit-flip errors from hardware "
"imperfections and readout errors, ensuring high-quality solutions even on "
"noisy quantum devices.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pendekatan hybrid ini mengkompensasi error bit-flip dari ketidaksempurnaan "
"perangkat keras dan error readout, memastikan solusi berkualitas tinggi "
"bahkan pada perangkat kuantum yang bising.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
