"Why bf-DCQO excels on current hardware {#why-bf-dcqo-excels-on-current-"
"hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Mengapa bf-DCQO unggul pada perangkat keras saat ini {#why-bf-dcqo-excels-"
"on-current-hardware}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The bf-DCQO algorithm is specifically designed to excel on today's noisy "
"intermediate-scale quantum (NISQ) devices [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma bf-DCQO dirancang khusus untuk unggul pada perangkat kuantum noisy"
" intermediate-scale (NISQ) saat ini [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Error resilience**: Fewer gates (10 times reduction) means dramatically "
"less error accumulation\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ketahanan terhadap error**: Lebih sedikit gate (pengurangan 10 kali) "
"berarti akumulasi error yang jauh lebih sedikit\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**No error mitigation required**: The algorithm's inherent efficiency "
"eliminates the need for expensive error mitigation techniques "
"[\\[1\\]](#references)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Tidak perlu mitigasi error**: Efisiensi inheren algoritma menghilangkan "
"kebutuhan teknik mitigasi error yang mahal [\\[1\\]](#references)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Scalability**: Can handle problems with up to 156 qubits (156 binary "
"variables) with direct qubit-mapping [\\[1\\]](#references)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Skalabilitas**: Dapat menangani masalah dengan hingga 156 qubit (156 "
"variabel biner) dengan direct qubit-mapping [\\[1\\]](#references)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Proven performance**: Achieves 100% approximation ratios on benchmark "
