# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Iskay returns a comprehensive result dictionary containing:\n"
"- **`solution`**: A dictionary mapping variable indices to their optimal values (0 or 1)\n"
"- **`solution_info`**: Detailed information including:\n"
"  - `bitstring`: The optimal assignment as a binary string\n"
"  - `cost`: The objective function value (should be 0 for perfect constraint satisfaction)\n"
"  - `mapping`: How bitstring positions map to problem variables\n"
"  - `seed_transpiler`: Seed used for reproducibility\n"
"- **`prob_type`**: Whether the solution is in binary or spin format\n"
msgstr ""
"Iskay mengembalikan kamus hasil yang komprehensif yang berisi:\n"
"- **`solution`**: Kamus yang memetakan indeks variabel ke nilai optimalnya (0 atau 1)\n"
"- **`solution_info`**: Informasi detail yang meliputi:\n"
"  - `bitstring`: Penugasan optimal sebagai string biner\n"
"  - `cost`: Nilai fungsi objektif (seharusnya 0 untuk pemenuhan constraint yang sempurna)\n"
"  - `mapping`: Bagaimana posisi bitstring dipetakan ke variabel masalah\n"
"  - `seed_transpiler`: Seed yang digunakan untuk reproduktibilitas\n"
"- **`prob_type`**: Apakah solusinya dalam format biner atau spin\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let's examine the solution returned by the quantum optimizer.\n"
msgstr "Mari kita periksa solusi yang dikembalikan oleh optimizer kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Solution validation {#solution-validation}"
msgstr "Validasi solusi {#solution-validation}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we validate whether the quantum solution satisfies the Market Split "
"constraints. The validation process checks:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita validasi apakah solusi kuantum memenuhi constraint Market "
"Split. Proses validasi memeriksa:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**What is a constraint violation?**\n"
"- For each product $i$, we calculate the actual sales in Region A: $(Ax)_i$\n"
"- We compare this to the target sales $b_i$\n"
"- The **violation** is the absolute difference: $|(Ax)_i - b_i|$\n"
"- A **feasible solution** has zero violations for all products\n"
msgstr ""
"**Apa itu pelanggaran constraint?**\n"
"- Untuk setiap produk $i$, kita hitung penjualan aktual di Wilayah A: $(Ax)_i$\n"
"- Kita bandingkan ini dengan target penjualan $b_i$\n"
"- **Pelanggaran** adalah selisih absolut: $|(Ax)_i - b_i|$\n"
"- **Solusi yang layak** memiliki nol pelanggaran untuk semua produk\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**What we expect:**\n"
"- **Ideal case**: Total violation = 0 (all constraints perfectly satisfied)\n"
"  - Region A gets exactly 1002 units of Product 1, 879 units of Product 2, and 1040 units of Product 3\n"
"  - Region B gets the remaining units (also 1002, 879, and 1040 respectively)\n"
"- **Good case**: Total violation is small (near-optimal solution)\n"
"- **Poor case**: Large violations indicate the solution doesn't satisfy the business requirements\n"
msgstr ""
"**Yang kita harapkan:**\n"
"- **Kasus ideal**: Total pelanggaran = 0 (semua constraint terpenuhi dengan sempurna)\n"
"  - Wilayah A mendapat tepat 1002 unit Produk 1, 879 unit Produk 2, dan 1040 unit Produk 3\n"
"  - Wilayah B mendapat unit yang tersisa (juga 1002, 879, dan 1040 masing-masing)\n"
"- **Kasus baik**: Total pelanggaran kecil (solusi hampir optimal)\n"
"- **Kasus buruk**: Pelanggaran besar menunjukkan solusi tidak memenuhi persyaratan bisnis\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The validation function will compute:\n"
"1. Actual sales per product in each region\n"
"2. Constraint violations for each product\n"
"3. Market distribution between regions\n"
msgstr ""
"Fungsi validasi akan menghitung:\n"
"1. Penjualan aktual per produk di setiap wilayah\n"
"2. Pelanggaran constraint untuk setiap produk\n"
"3. Distribusi pasar antara wilayah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Interpret the validation results {#interpret-the-validation-results}"
msgstr "Interpretasi hasil validasi {#interpret-the-validation-results}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The validation results show whether the Quantum Optimizer found a feasible "
"solution. Let's examine the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Hasil validasi menunjukkan apakah Quantum Optimizer menemukan solusi yang "
"layak. Mari kita periksa hal-hal berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Feasibility check:**\n"
"- **`is_feasible = True`** means the solution perfectly satisfies all constraints (total violation = 0)\n"
"- **`is_feasible = False`** means some constraints are violated\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pemeriksaan kelayakan:**\n"
"- **`is_feasible = True`** berarti solusi memenuhi semua constraint dengan sempurna (total pelanggaran = 0)\n"
"- **`is_feasible = False`** berarti ada beberapa constraint yang dilanggar\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Sales analysis:**\n"
"- Compare Target versus Actual sales for each product\n"
"- For a perfect solution: Actual = Target for all products in both regions\n"
"- The difference indicates how close we are to the desired market split\n"
msgstr ""
"**Analisis penjualan:**\n"
"- Bandingkan Target versus Penjualan Aktual untuk setiap produk\n"
"- Untuk solusi yang sempurna: Aktual = Target untuk semua produk di kedua wilayah\n"
"- Selisihnya menunjukkan seberapa dekat kita dengan pembagian pasar yang diinginkan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Market distribution:**\n"
"- Shows how many markets are assigned to each region\n"
"- There's no requirement for equal numbers of markets, only that sales targets are met\n"
msgstr ""
"**Distribusi pasar:**\n"
"- Menunjukkan berapa banyak pasar yang ditugaskan ke setiap wilayah\n"
"- Tidak ada persyaratan untuk jumlah pasar yang sama, hanya target penjualan yang harus terpenuhi\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Solution quality assessment {#solution-quality-assessment}"
msgstr "Penilaian kualitas solusi {#solution-quality-assessment}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Based on the validation results above, we can assess the quality of the "
"quantum solution:\n"
msgstr ""
"Berdasarkan hasil validasi di atas, kita bisa menilai kualitas solusi "
"kuantum:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If `is_feasible = True` (Total violation = 0):**\n"
"- The Quantum Optimizer successfully found an optimal solution\n"
"- All business constraints are perfectly satisfied\n"
"- This demonstrates quantum advantage on a problem where classical solvers struggle [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jika `is_feasible = True` (Total pelanggaran = 0):**\n"
"- Quantum Optimizer berhasil menemukan solusi yang optimal\n"
"- Semua constraint bisnis terpenuhi dengan sempurna\n"
"- Ini mendemonstrasikan keunggulan kuantum pada masalah di mana solver klasik kesulitan [\\[4\\]](#references)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If `is_feasible = False` (Total violation > 0):**\n"
"- The solution is near-optimal but not perfect\n"
"- Small violations may be acceptable in practice\n"
"- Consider adjusting optimizer parameters:\n"
"  - Increase `num_iterations` for more optimization passes\n"
"  - Increase `postprocessing_level` for more classical refinement\n"
"  - Increase `shots` for better measurement statistics\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jika `is_feasible = False` (Total pelanggaran > 0):**\n"
"- Solusinya hampir optimal tapi tidak sempurna\n"
"- Pelanggaran kecil mungkin masih bisa diterima dalam praktik\n"
"- Pertimbangkan untuk menyesuaikan parameter optimizer:\n"
"  - Tambah `num_iterations` untuk lebih banyak pass optimasi\n"
"  - Tambah `postprocessing_level` untuk lebih banyak penyempurnaan klasik\n"
"  - Tambah `shots` untuk statistik pengukuran yang lebih baik\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Cost function interpretation:**\n"
"- The `cost` value from `solution_info` equals $||Ax - b||^2$\n"
"- Cost = 0 indicates perfect constraint satisfaction\n"
"- Higher cost values indicate larger constraint violations\n"
msgstr ""
"**Interpretasi fungsi cost:**\n"
"- Nilai `cost` dari `solution_info` sama dengan $||Ax - b||^2$\n"
"- Cost = 0 menandakan pemenuhan constraint yang sempurna\n"
"- Nilai cost yang lebih tinggi menandakan pelanggaran constraint yang lebih besar\n"

