#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Poin-poin utama {#key-takeaways}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Algorithm innovation**: The bf-DCQO algorithm represents a significant advancement [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- **10 times fewer gates** than digital quantum annealing\n"
"- **Approximately 10 iterations** instead of approximately 100 for variational methods\n"
"- **Built-in error resilience** through circuit efficiency\n"
msgstr ""
"**Inovasi algoritma**: Algoritma bf-DCQO merepresentasikan kemajuan signifikan [\\[1\\]](#references):\n"
"- **10 kali lebih sedikit Gate** dibandingkan digital quantum annealing\n"
"- **Sekitar 10 iterasi** alih-alih sekitar 100 untuk metode variasional\n"
"- **Ketahanan terhadap error yang built-in** melalui efisiensi Circuit\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Counterdiabatic terms**: Enable rapid quantum evolution while maintaining "
"ground state fidelity, making quantum optimization practical on today's "
"noisy hardware [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Suku-suku counterdiabatic**: Memungkinkan evolusi kuantum yang cepat "
"sambil mempertahankan kesetiaan ground state, membuat optimasi kuantum "
"praktis di perangkat keras berderau saat ini [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Bias-field guidance**: The iterative bias-field approach allows each "
"iteration to start near previously found good solutions, providing a form of"
" quantum-enhanced local search [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Panduan bias-field**: Pendekatan bias-field iteratif memungkinkan setiap "
"iterasi untuk memulai dekat dengan solusi baik yang ditemukan sebelumnya, "
"memberikan bentuk quantum-enhanced local search [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

